---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-images">
        <div class="about-img-main">
          <img src="/images/workshop.jpg" alt="Inside the Hartwood workshop" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="about-img-accent"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-img-secondary">
          <img src="/images/craftsmanship.jpg" alt="Hand-cut dovetail joinery detail" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-badge">
          <span class="badge-number">27</span>
          <span class="badge-text">Years of<br />Excellence</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Three Generations of <em>Woodworking Mastery</em></h2>
        <p class="about-lead">
          Founded in 1997 by master craftsman James Hartwell, our workshop has
          grown from a one-man garage into the region's most trusted name in
          custom cabinetry&mdash;without ever losing the personal touch that
          defines true craftsmanship.
        </p>
        <p class="about-body">
          Today, James works alongside his daughter Emily and a small team of
          dedicated artisans. Every cabinet that leaves our shop still bears the
          hallmarks that James insisted on from day one: hand-selected lumber,
          traditional joinery, and a finish that only comes from patience and
          pride.
        </p>
        <div class="about-values">
          <div class="value">
            <div class="value-icon">&#10003;</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Hand-Selected Lumber</h4>
              <p>Personally chosen for grain, color, and character</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <div class="value-icon">&#10003;</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Traditional Joinery</h4>
              <p>Dovetails, mortise-and-tenon, built to last generations</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="value">
            <div class="value-icon">&#10003;</div>
            <div>
              <h4>Furniture-Grade Finish</h4>
              <p>Multiple hand-rubbed coats for enduring beauty</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Visit Our Workshop</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 7rem 0;
    background: var(--color-ivory);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-images {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-img-main {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(44, 24, 16, 0.15);
  }

  .about-img-main img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-img-accent {
    position: absolute;
    top: -15px;
    left: -15px;
    width: 50%;
    height: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .about-img-secondary {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -30px;
    right: -30px;
    width: 55%;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(44, 24, 16, 0.2);
    border: 5px solid var(--color-ivory);
  }

  .about-img-secondary img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3/2;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    right: -10px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(184, 146, 63, 0.3);
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .badge-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .badge-text {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .section-title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-walnut-light);
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-walnut);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-smoke);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-values {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .value {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .value-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    background: var(--color-gold);
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .value h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .value p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-smoke);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 1rem 2.25rem;
    border: 1.5px solid;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-espresso);
    border-color: var(--color-espresso);
    color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-walnut);
    border-color: var(--color-walnut);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(44, 24, 16, 0.2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }

    .about-images {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-badge {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
    }

    .badge-number {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .badge-text {
      font-size: 0.55rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-img-secondary {
      position: static;
      width: 70%;
      margin: -20px auto 0;
      border: 3px solid var(--color-ivory);
    }
  }
</style>